 the pinned upstream no-copy path if the copy is dropped') potentially non-reproducing and the cited line numbers potentially stale.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f87d42164d1f48fcd","impact":0.33,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach — 'Pass a fresh dict(...) per call' paragraph; Acceptance Criteria — 'The configured headers mapping is not mutated by a model call'","norm_id":"nd15837a1cb65cb0b","priority":0.1833,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["A future or already-resolved pydantic-ai within >=1.107,<2 carries PR 6868's fix, so a dropped copy no longer mutates the caller dict and the non-mutation test passes even when the defensive copy is gone — the regression the AC exists to catch is silently unguarded."],"severity":"minor","suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.5556,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"no","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"yes","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"none","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"silent","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"low"}}},{"block_threshold":0.6,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"Clarify whether delivery-time re-validation covers (a) unsafe resolved values (CR/LF/NUL introduced by a run value) — the genuinely new second-seam gap — versus (b) unknown run keys, which headers.py already